{"version":1,"content":"<p>11月11日，知情人士透露，人工智能公司Anthropic的首次公開募股（IPO）已獲得數倍超額認購，投資者認購意向遠超可供發行的股票數量，顯示機構投資者對這家Claude開發商的上市計劃需求強勁。此次認購主要受到大型機構投資者提交大額認購意向的推動，具體發行安排仍可能調整。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585964.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-11T14:59:54.420969+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":143,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-11T14:38:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:14.097811+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-11T14:53:14.097811+00:00","content_hash":"cab77eaa29ac728cad3717fd08de4ef52e2e35b6e4db4b31e7a95af74ef38d9f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}